WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.409
Most Americans have come around to

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.869
believing that COVID-19 originated

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.059
in a lab and not in a wet market

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.099
in Wuhan, as China's CDC

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.779
claimed in March of 2020.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.399
The former director of the CDC has

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.899
come around to believing that a lab

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.639
origin is more likely, as has the

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.559
former head of the Lancet medical

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.599
journals, COVID-19 Commission.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.639
But I chaired the Commission for

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.489
the Lancet for two years on COVID.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.379
I'm pretty convinced it came out

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.379
of the US lab of biotechnology,

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.909
not out of nature.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:32.099
Journalists and scientists routinely

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.899
dismissed the lab leak hypothesis as

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.639
a crackpot theory up until the

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.619
summer of 2021, when science

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.149
journalist Nicholas Wade published

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.979
an influential article and a

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.109
viral rant by Jon Stewart.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.119
The disease is the same

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.769
name as the lab.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.269
Pushed it into the mainstream.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.069
Up until that point, social media

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.629
platforms had been removing or

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.129
throttling posts that took a

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.089
seriously.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.069
Anthony Fauci and NIH director

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.019
Francis Collins said it wasn't even

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.579
worth considering the possibility

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.199
that COVID could have originated in

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:01.889
the lab.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.449
He tells National Geographic.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:04.919
Everything about the stepwise

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.629
evolution over time strongly

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.549
indicates that this virus evolved in

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.979
nature and then jumped species.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.809
Fauci added he does not believe

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.489
another theory that the virus

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.929
occurred naturally but was

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.369
accidentally released into the

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.169
public from a lab in China.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.209
More recently, emails made public

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:22.469
through the Freedom of Information

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:23.939
Act have revealed that Fauci,

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.799
Collins, and other prominent public

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.569
officials took the possibility of a

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.579
lab leak origin far more

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.619
seriously than they were letting on.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.659
Top virologists sort of giants

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.739
in this field.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.469
We're looking at the genome and

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:40.049
I mean freaking out, basically.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.759
Reporter Emily Kopp works at the

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:42.899
nonprofit U.S.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.209
Right to Know, an organization

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.399
that has obtained thousands of pages

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.509
of official documents, of

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:50.159
correspondence, some of which

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.049
revealed an orchestrated effort

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.269
by scientists to downplay

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:55.949
the lab leak theory.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.869
They've also extensively analyzed

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:59.819
emails obtained via a lawsuit by

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.979
BuzzFeed's Jason Leopold

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.139
that reveal the huge disconnect

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.489
between what health officials were

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.169
telling the public and what they

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.609
were saying in private.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:10.439
I think this is a really

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.419
important question and

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.549
a really central part of this entire

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.469
story that maybe is not

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.089
talked about enough.

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:20.309
The fact that so many

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.019
mainstream publications have

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.089
completely overlooked

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.099
really key pieces of evidence

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.509
in this story.

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.669
And my

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.529
theory, and I think about this a

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.360
lot, is essentially that,

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.329
you know, health editors, the people

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.009
who are making decisions about what

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.329
to cover and what not to cover at

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.009
major news organizations, at least

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.139
when it comes to the Health Beat,

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.999
are friends with Anthony

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.309
Fauci. They've known him for,

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.079
you know, decades in some in some

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.039
cases.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.409
And it's

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.689
probably very challenging to

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.740
examine

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:59.399
the possibility

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.439
that research funded

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.389
by Fauci's Institute

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.059
might have had unintentional

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.199
consequences.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.029
And so

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.949
essentially, I think, to

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.779
put it very starkly, we see a lot

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:13.829
of health editors and health

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.319
reporters prioritizing

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.959
a tidy narrative about

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.259
Anthony Fauci over,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.729
you know, providing the truth to

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:24.569
their readers.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.819
And I think readers

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:28.829
deserve to understand the

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:30.689
full scope of possibilities

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.549
when it comes to the origins of

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:33.419
the pandemic.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.519
Kopp has assembled a comprehensive

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.739
timeline that lays out substantial

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.599
evidence that Fauci,

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.939
Collins, and a number of influential

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.799
scientists misled the

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.659
public. Whether or not the lab leak

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.579
theory is correct, it's

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.499
now clear that these public

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.779
officials concealed their conflicts

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.519
of interest with the Wuhan Institute

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.529
of Virology and minimized

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.359
their own roles in providing the

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.949
government funding for the

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.629
unsupervised gain of function

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.249
research that may have led to the

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.059
pandemic.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.949
Among other things, Kopp's research

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.869
has revealed that virologist

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.239
Kristian Andersen wrote privately

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.069
to Fauci that he and three

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.629
other scientists thought that the

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:13.770
virus that causes COVID-19

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.429
looked unnatural and inconsistent

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.289
with expectations from evolutionary

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.299
theory. Just four days later,

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.099
after participating in a series of

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.539
teleconferences with Fauci and

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.339
Collins, Andersen called the Lab

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.379
Leak Theory Crackpot.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.329
Other emails revealed that Fauci

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.039
knew that his agency was funding

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.059
gain of function research

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.519
with SARS-likecoronaviruses in Wuhan

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.099
by late January of 2020.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.809
Yet he publicly denied it before

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:40.619
Congress.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.969
18 months later.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.619
Will you today finally take some

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.479
responsibility for funding gain

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.949
of function research in Wuhan?

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.049
Senator, with all due respect, I

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.879
disagree with so many of the things

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:55.880
that you've said.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.779
First of all, gain of function

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.289
is a very nebulous term.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.219
Kopp works for the nonprofit US

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.839
Right to Know, which is devoting

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.519
significant resources to its

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:08.499
biohazards project with

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.939
the mission of investigating the

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.069
origins of COVID-19, the risks

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:14.019
of gain of function research, and

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.179
mishaps of Biolabs where pathogens

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.729
of pandemic potential are stored

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:19.730
and manipulated.

